[
  {
    "id": "327a5c2209dd2c589263",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/druid/4/levels/2/0/d",
    "source": "A charted map serving as your spellcasting focus; you know guidance and can cast guiding bolt a proficiency-bonus number of times per long rest without a slot.",
    "sourceHash": "27c98cfe5751c61cd7905b4b389bfeff1421343c41a57e6c09204e75f026d5cd"
  },
  {
    "id": "7d607ce59f34b5714e1c",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/druid/4/levels/2/1/n",
    "source": "Starry Form",
    "sourceHash": "9290055db34928ac04be31de11a97705d7f1f1fedf6eaf9c0225ff4d02f63368"
  },
  {
    "id": "e713a18c072d0dc88ee7",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/druid/4/levels/2/1/d",
    "source": "Spend a Wild Shape use to glow with a constellation for 10 minutes: Archer gives a bonus-action ranged attack for 1d8 + Wisdom radiant damage, Chalice heals a second creature whenever you cast a healing spell, Dragon lets you treat a d20 of 9 or lower as a 10 on Intelligence and Wisdom checks and concentration saves.",
    "sourceHash": "625d3b07e793e5a0c44c0edf13780c573b261d44e466ac0fb466769babd182b1"
  },
  {
    "id": "6cdb7de196c36ba93eeb",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/druid/4/levels/6/0/n",
    "source": "Cosmic Omen",
    "sourceHash": "20693caa7397c527991351caec396cac646684b944b35c04a323a62e519d0674"
  },
  {
    "id": "616490867a2f71baeab6",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/druid/4/levels/6/0/d",
    "source": "After a long rest, read your map for Weal or Woe; a reaction then adds or subtracts a d6 on a roll near you, a proficiency-bonus number of times per long rest.",
    "sourceHash": "718487e02f0d3e2a5f6693f41acd4107ff62ef01ad40e3868608fc8bd32dceef"
  },
  {
    "id": "3d7c113192ece44d8374",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/druid/4/levels/10/0/n",
    "source": "Twinkling Constellations",
    "sourceHash": "a145dafea873c7a70ec540f0552cf3fbe900886a9b6acae3d6b615bbe4f1ab63"
  },
  {
    "id": "c81312ee93764aab0a2a",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/druid/4/levels/10/0/d",
    "source": "Starry Form improves: Archer and Chalice roll 2d8, Dragon grants a 20-foot fly speed, and you may change constellation each turn.",
    "sourceHash": "b9e083a7e5da581fdc844a6f7617d79fca88cca036f59205e61d1a3ca807a197"
  },
  {
    "id": "936843a78f6992f9cc0e",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/druid/4/levels/14/0/n",
    "source": "Full of Stars",
    "sourceHash": "b2845da14461ce530c6daba110ba2607619f47d3fe3ab9e905311a0b7198101e"
  },
  {
    "id": "10b545d49352459119bf",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/druid/4/levels/14/0/d",
    "source": "While in Starry Form you are partly incorporeal and resist bludgeoning, piercing and slashing damage.",
    "sourceHash": "d4cda215b5eeb21782784b72d3b113905954b3f7ef9881ffa76c5cc502101d99"
  },
  {
    "id": "176c8a65f0304a4eb49c",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/druid/5/name",
    "source": "Circle of Wildfire",
    "sourceHash": "8fbcf0e42398d509ca7dc9c2bd9656bc3c0e6be6050022db9de4ee9c2c29494d"
  },
  {
    "id": "adaf8333d8bd6bf797c3",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/druid/5/desc",
    "source": "A druid bonded to a wildfire spirit, holding to the truth that fire clears ground for new growth.",
    "sourceHash": "e9a00cf24d337dfc6872c76528e96cf22d61df8bb364c02731fcadad3e5564f2"
  },
  {
    "id": "416aa690479a6323d5ad",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/druid/5/levels/2/0/n",
    "source": "Summon Wildfire Spirit",
    "sourceHash": "0f132a133171fbb39acbd0c24dc46bbfe5310302e02fb3c2b5b4fa436d388c18"
  },
  {
    "id": "fddd7625a9d6a5c7ffa9",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/druid/5/levels/2/0/d",
    "source": "Spend a Wild Shape use to summon a wildfire spirit companion that acts on your turn, with a fiery teleport that damages creatures around its arrival.",
    "sourceHash": "63485c3932600b60b72c4944c3d8cd2c9508375397b09e80a06917a4fb023aaa"
  },
  {
    "id": "8c3c18e180bcc770e225",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/druid/5/levels/6/0/n",
    "source": "Enhanced Bond",
    "sourceHash": "3e2d769c8305253f507ab0e443e409024a3c1614a469eb8a1c2a040a4fa0085d"
  },
  {
    "id": "5fa273771c5c0e052c60",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/druid/5/levels/6/0/d",
    "source": "While the spirit is out, your fire and healing spells gain 1d8, and you may cast them from the spirit's position.",
    "sourceHash": "e3c162c710822883b931f05e21138bd4596feee1150cb186e2a1c1ebada8ad21"
  },
  {
    "id": "5c75c6904d8d563ad5e1",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/druid/5/levels/10/0/n",
    "source": "Cauterizing Flames",
    "sourceHash": "d2e2829fcd325c403e8d24b687bf12f06f289f9eb02c183143a87c39f5194b12"
  },
  {
    "id": "93ecb6eb3fffc853fd46",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/druid/5/levels/10/0/d",
    "source": "When a Small or larger creature dies within 30 feet of you or your wildfire spirit, a spectral flame burns in its space for a minute. When a creature you can see enters that space, a reaction puts the flame out to restore 2d10 + your Wisdom modifier hit points to it or deal it that much fire damage; a proficiency-bonus number of times per long rest.",
    "sourceHash": "410c4394bc37684c63950c9bfa402c9102fa4003303e3b88c42c000c07d3361c"
  },
  {
    "id": "4c3224f21501847df54b",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/druid/5/levels/14/0/n",
    "source": "Blazing Revival",
    "sourceHash": "eca80d70c2f41f8f2f168044bf16d0e89db50866787cfdc69ee8e8789a6bbb35"
  },
  {
    "id": "7ba080fcfeaf6cc578fa",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/druid/5/levels/14/0/d",
    "source": "Once per long rest, dropping to 0 hit points destroys the spirit and returns you to half your hit point maximum instead.",
    "sourceHash": "c3207294b394b55cbad94d5796b52f37db301cca3ef414da22ead0dc1d007519"
  },
  {
    "id": "11b24fc56d2e2f086a82",
    "sourceFile": "src/lib/srd/subclasses.json",
    "pointer": "/classes/fighter/0/name",
