    "pointer": "/classes/fighter/0/levels/7/0/d",
    "source": "A minute of observation reveals whether a creature beats you in two chosen traits such as Strength, Dexterity, Constitution, AC, current hit points, class levels or fighter levels.",
    "sourceHash": "278cf02190efc0e98d2987c519d5958f94e3778c6baf79a5d97b4eb80787285c"
  },
